# `permissions.create`

Create a new permission preset (errors if the id is taken).

**Policy** — command `[C2_ELEVATED]`. Capability `ship.permissions.write`.

## Arguments

| name | type | required |
|------|------|----------|
| `id` | `string` | yes |
| `preset_json` | `string` | yes |
| `scope` | `string?` | no |

